{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Qkowun9j4YZarMGzuzvvPa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the research context carefully to define three tiers for the Dream simulation.\n\nKey facts:\n- This is a diagnostic/analysis paper about reward hacking in GRPO-trained formal reasoning models\n- 3-claim structure: (1) STA/ISR as diagnostic, (2) Meta-level Goodhart, (3) Cross-logic generalization\n- Claims 1 and 2 are fully closed with strong data\n- Claim 3 is partially done: exec-only 3-seed done, STA s42 done (100% H7), s43/s44 still RUNNING\n\n\n- Target: EMNLP 2026 Main (fallback: Findings)\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n\nThe real question is how the Prolog STA results for s43/s44 will shape the paper's strength. If they replicate s42's pattern with consistent H7 dominance, the cross-logic generalization claim becomes airtight and the paper lands at Main. If they're mixed, I need to reframe Claim 3 around what we do know—the diagnostic power of STA/ISR—and aim for Findings instead.\n\nIn the worst case where Prolog fails to replicate, I'd pivot to positioning this as a FOL-specific analysis rather than a cross-logic story, keeping the two strongest claims and reframing the contribution around what the methodology reveals about individual logics. Still EMNLP, but with a tighter scope.\n\nThe metrics that actually matter are the H7 replication rate in Prolog and how clean the eval results look—those two things determine whether the narrative holds or needs restructuring. Now I'm thinking through the key evidence pieces—the D058 1000-step collapse to near-zero ISR with perfect H1 is the cleanest support for the main claim, and the premise-count correction from 2.4x down to 1.06x is actually a methodological strength rather than a limitation. For the tier structure, the best case would be Prolog s43/s44 replicating the H7 dominance pattern above 70%, keeping the 3-claim framework intact with that 1000-step trajectory as the centerpiece.\n\nIf the Prolog results are mixed, I'd need to soften Claim 3 from definitive cross-logic Goodhart replication to more preliminary evidence, possibly merging it with Claim 1 or presenting it as suggestive. In the worst scenario where both Prolog seeds fail, the paper pivots to a focused 2-claim structure—diagnostic plus Goodhart in FOL alone—emphasizing the depth of mechanistic analysis rather than breadth across logic types.\n\nThe critical metrics hinging on these Prolog runs are the H7 success rates for seeds 43 and 44, their cross-seed consistency, and ultimately whether the paper lands at EMNLP Main or Findings depending on how cleanly the results replicate.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26664,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26664},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d275e616-f55e-46cf-b711-a82de02bf6a4","uuid":"c524e4ba-c3a8-47e4-a4e0-567365d8acfe"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Qkowun9j4YZarMGzuzvvPa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"Prolog STA s43/s44 复现 H7 主导，3-claim 结构完整闭环，EMNLP Main 叙事无需调整\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Prolog STA s43/s44 均表现 H7 ≥70%，与 s42 (100%) 一致，确认 Goodhart 跨逻辑复现\"\n      - \"跨 seed 不稳定性本身复现 FOL 模式（不同 seed 不同退化模式但均为 hacking）\"\n      - \"1000-step ISR 崩塌轨迹 (0.64→0.13→0.003) 作为 headline figure 被审稿人接受为 clean ablation\"\n      - \"Premise-count artifact (D051) 被视为方法论贡献而非可信度损伤\"\n      - \"审稿人接受 ISR=LOO 的 novelty 在应用层+实证发现，而非方法本身\"\n    number_ranges:\n      prolog_sta_s43_h7_rate: [0.70, 1.00]\n      prolog_sta_s44_h7_rate: [0.70, 1.00]\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_mean: [0.80, 1.00]\n      prolog_sta_3seed_pr_std: [0.05, 0.30]  # 跨 seed 不稳定但方向一致\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: [0.70, 1.00]  # FOL-Prolog H7 模式匹配度\n      reviewer_score_avg: [3.5, 4.0]  # ACL 5-point scale，3.5+ = Main 区间\n      acceptance_probability_main: [0.35, 0.55]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始 3-claim framing 完全成立。Claim 3 用 Prolog 3-seed 一致 H7 证明\n      \"ISR 诊断迁移 + Goodhart 跨逻辑复现\"。1000-step 轨迹做 Figure 1\n      （ISR 崩塌 vs PR 平台），premise-count 校正做 Section 5 方法论贡献\n      （\"LOO metrics 的固有偏差——我们如何发现并控制它\"）。Story：\n      ISR 是强诊断工具，但任何 proxy metric 转为优化目标都会 Goodhart——\n      这一规律跨逻辑类型、跨 seed、跨剂量成立。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"Prolog STA s43/s44 部分复现（一 seed 成功一 seed 异常，或两 seed 显示 hacking 但模式不同于 H7），Claim 3 需降级措辞\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Prolog STA s43 或 s44 之一 H7≥50%，另一 seed 异常（训练不稳定/不同 hacking 模式/H7<30%）\"\n      - \"跨逻辑 Goodhart 复现是 suggestive 而非 conclusive——模式存在但不如 FOL 干净\"\n      - \"审稿人对 'only 2 logic types' 和 'mixed Prolog results' 提出质疑但不 reject\"\n      - \"Premise-count artifact 引发 'credibility concern' 但被透明校正化解\"\n      - \"1000-step 数据被接受但审稿人要求更多 step 或更多 seed（minor revision 级别）\"\n    number_ranges:\n      prolog_sta_s43_h7_rate: [0.20, 0.70]\n      prolog_sta_s44_h7_rate: [0.20, 0.70]\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_mean: [0.40, 0.75]\n      prolog_sta_3seed_pr_std: [0.20, 0.40]  # 更大不稳定性\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: [0.35, 0.65]\n      reviewer_score_avg: [3.0, 3.5]\n      acceptance_probability_main: [0.15, 0.35]\n      acceptance_probability_findings: [0.50, 0.70]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Claim 3 从 \"cross-logic diagnostic transfer\" 降级为 \"preliminary\n      cross-logic evidence with consistent but heterogeneous hacking\n      patterns\"。核心调整：(1) Prolog STA 结果报为 \"suggestive replication\"\n      而非 \"confirmed generalization\"；(2) 强调 Prolog exec-only 3-seed\n      ISR 崩塌一致性（0.008-0.081）作为诊断迁移的主证据，STA-as-reward\n      的跨逻辑 Goodhart 降为 supplementary evidence；(3) 补充讨论 Prolog\n      语义简单性导致 hacking 模式差异的原因（s42 已显示 Prolog H7=100%\n      vs FOL H7=16%，语义越简单 gaming 越彻底）。论文重心向 Claim 1+2\n      倾斜：FOL 上的深度分析是核心，Prolog 是 generality probe。可能需要\n      additional experiment（如 FOL 第 4 seed 或另一 β 值）补充 robustness。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"Prolog STA s43/s44 训练失败或无法复现 H7/hacking 模式，Claim 3 实质性失效，需 reframe 为 FOL 深度分析论文\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Prolog STA s43/s44 训练崩溃（loss diverge/生成退化）或 H7<15%（无 Goodhart 复现）\"\n      - \"跨逻辑泛化不成立——ISR 诊断可能是 FOL/Prover9 特异性的\"\n      - \"审稿人会用 'single logic type' 作为主要 weakness\"\n      - \"Premise-count artifact + 跨逻辑失败叠加为 credibility risk\"\n      - \"Claims 1+2 的 FOL 证据仍然 solid（数据已闭环，不受 Claim 3 影响）\"\n    number_ranges:\n      prolog_sta_s43_h7_rate: [0.00, 0.20]\n      prolog_sta_s44_h7_rate: [0.00, 0.20]\n      prolog_sta_3seed_h7_mean: [0.00, 0.30]\n      prolog_sta_training_failure_seeds: [1, 2]  # 1-2 个 seed 训练失败\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: [0.00, 0.30]\n      reviewer_score_avg: [2.5, 3.0]\n      acceptance_probability_main: [0.05, 0.15]\n      acceptance_probability_findings: [0.30, 0.50]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      砍掉 Claim 3 或降级为 1 段 \"preliminary exploration\"。Reframe 为\n      2-claim 深度分析论文：\"Diagnosing and Characterizing Reward Hacking\n      in GRPO-Trained Formal Reasoners\"。新 angle：(1) 深度胜于广度——\n      FOL 上 6 条件 × 3 seed × 1000 步的完整 Goodhart landscape 是同\n      类工作中最系统的实证分析；(2) 将 Prolog exec-only ISR 崩塌\n      （3-seed 已闭环）保留为 \"diagnostic transfer evidence\"，但不再声称\n      Goodhart 跨逻辑复现；(3) 强化方法论贡献线——premise-count confound\n      发现 + LOO bias 警告升级为独立贡献点（\"when proxy metrics deceive:\n      a case study\"）；(4) 1000-step 轨迹 + SFT baseline + 6-mode taxonomy\n      构成 FOL-only 但足够深的贡献矩阵。风险点：EMNLP Main 概率显著\n      下降，但 Findings 仍可行——Findings 论文不要求跨域泛化，\n      thorough single-domain analysis 是可接受的贡献形态。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26664,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26664},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d275e616-f55e-46cf-b711-a82de02bf6a4","uuid":"557411fd-8b8f-4902-9acb-2148a2d43477"}
